From c7ac8ee9d08b17e750c6ac2088d5d44431a70d8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 00:35:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Assign the Equality Arizona Parquet download to the right
 variable

When equalityArizona2022SineDieReport.parquet downloads successfully, its
contents were stored in session57HouseLegislativeMemberVotingHistory, so
the exported equalityArizona2022SineDieReport stayed undefined. This only
shows up once the Parquet file exists in the datasets repository; today
it returns 404 and the fallback, which uses the right name, runs instead.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QWRPxicSd3Kac8FLRGwu74
---
 src/AZLegInfo.jl | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/AZLegInfo.jl b/src/AZLegInfo.jl
index 2920f58..8265917 100644
--- a/src/AZLegInfo.jl
+++ b/src/AZLegInfo.jl
@@ -166,7 +166,7 @@ try
   tempPath, io= mktemp()
   close(io)
   Downloads.download("https://codeberg.org/AZLegInfo/datasets/raw/branch/main/equalityArizona2022SineDieReport.parquet", tempPath)
-  global session57HouseLegislativeMemberVotingHistory = DataFrame(Parquet.read_parquet(tempPath))
+  global equalityArizona2022SineDieReport = DataFrame(Parquet.read_parquet(tempPath))
 catch e
   println("Error Downloading equalityArizona2022SineDieReport: ", e)
   global equalityArizona2022SineDieReport = getEqualityArizona2022SineDieReport()
